{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Makes a New Friend"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Text from Marco"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs"}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le06ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Present Continuous Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Continuous Tense to talk about: <ul><li> an action happening at the time of speaking or writing </li><li> an action happening in the near future, when the time and place are decided </li><li>To make a difference between actions happening now and future actions, time expressions are essential.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm just thinking about you. (now)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm wondering if you want to go out. (now)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm going hiking <span class=\"strong\">this weekend</span>. (future)"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking If or When People Are Free"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you want to spend time with someone, you ask them if or when they are free."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use these phrases to ask people if or when they are free:"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm wondering if you want to go out sometime? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Are you free on Saturday?"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Are you off tomorrow night?"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Are you off tomorrow night? How does Saturday sound?"}, {"type": "example", "content": " When are you free to hang out?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I'm wondering if ...</span> <br><span class=\"italic\">Are you free on ... ? </span><br><span class=\"italic\">Are you off ... ?</span> <br><span class=\"italic\">How does</span> (day) <span class=\"italic\">sound? </span><br><span class=\"italic\">When are you free to ... ?</span><br> <span class=\"italic\">What day are you free on?</span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spot "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small area "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I will take you to my favorite spot."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about free time activities."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "picnic "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " taking food to eat outside "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to have picnics with my friends."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "boots"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "shoes that you wear for working outside or hiking "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Bring your boots!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gardening"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the action of planting, watering and caring for plants "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to do the gardening on Saturdays."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hiking "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the action of walking up a mountain "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like hiking."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to pick up "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to get someone in a car and take them somewhere "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can pick you up at 11:30."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to wear "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have clothes on your body or shoes on your feet"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Wear your hiking boots!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le06ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Get a copy of a calendar for this month or this week."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your partner if and when they are free during the month."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write days that they are free on the calendar."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 5 sentences summarizing when they are free."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I ask if and when someone is free."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write the answers in the calendar."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a summary of the information."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le06ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le06ob07re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le06ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>:<br>\nHey, Vanessa. It's Marco. I'm just thinking about you. I'm wondering if you want to go out sometime? I'm going hiking this weekend. Are you interested? I would love to take you to my favorite picnic spot. Let me know.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le06ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:<br>\nMarco! Nice to hear from you! Yes, I would love to go hiking with you. I love having picnics, too. Sounds great. Where and when?", "id": 2, "time": "15000", "image": "engenn5le06ob07re2img08.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>:<br>\nHow does Saturday sound? I'm checking the weather now and it looks like it's sunny all weekend. Are you free Saturday?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:<br>\nYes, Saturday's good. I usually do the gardening on Saturdays, but I can do that on Sunday. What should I bring?", "id": 3, "time": "27500", "image": "engenn5le06ob07re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>:<br>\nNothing! Just remember to wear your hiking boots. I'll bring everything else. I'll pick you up at 11:30.<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: <br/>See you then!<br>", "id": 4, "time": "44500", "image": "engenn5le06ob07re2img06.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le06ob07re6aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le06ob07re6img01.jpg", "images": []}}]}, {"id": 3, "type": "text", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": ""}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can say what I'm doing right now or in the future. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can ask if / when people are free. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about free time activities."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What are you doing this weekend?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What are you doing after your English class?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Do you 